data/raw/revelio/revelio_positions_enriched.parquet
data/raw/revelio/revelio_user.parquet
data/raw/revelio/_revelio_input.csv

# Superseded, pre-pipeline exploratory work area. Duplicates code/03_analysis/labor_market_effects/
# with extra Revelio fields and its own copy of the name-to-LinkedIn-URL crosswalk. Not part of the
# clean reproduction package. Its WiP/ subfolder (superseded draft scripts, intermediate results,
# pre-publication memos/reports) has been moved to archive/labor_market_wip/ (see below) -- kept
# locally for the project's own record, but not published.
/revelio_pull/

# Everything historical/dropped (scripts and outputs from earlier paper drafts no longer published,
# the labor-market analysis's exploratory trail, pre-publication draft memos/reports) is kept for the
# authors' own record but not published. See each subfolder for what it holds; archive/README.md
# documents the dropped-analysis scripts and PIPELINE_TODO.md documents the rest.
/archive/

# paper/latex_overleaf/ is its own separate git repo (synced to a private Overleaf remote) and is
# not included here at all -- git refuses to recurse into an embedded repository anyway. A flattened,
# non-git snapshot of its current content is checked in instead at paper/latex/ (see README.md).
/paper/latex_overleaf/

